      "message": "Wrapping here hides a NetconfDocumentedException from the master (e.g. lock-denied from Candidate.lock) as a cause, and NetconfDataOperations.decodeException only checks the top-level type, so a slave reports a generic operation-failed where the master node reports the device\u0027s error tag. Could we pass NetconfDocumentedException through unwrapped, or have decodeException search the cause chain?",
